# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local-only working context — never pushed to the shared repo.
# Ignore rules do NOT apply to already-tracked files, so the committed docs
# (docs/PROJECT_DESIGN.md, docs/GKD_ON_POLICY_PIPELINE.md, docs/PREREG_XSIZE.md,
# and the root CLAUDE.md / ARCHITECTURE.md / README.md) stay tracked and
# updatable. Only *new* files under these paths are held back.
# Add a genuinely shareable new doc with an explicit `git add -f <path>`.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.claude/
docs/
papers/
figures/
notebooks/exports/

